{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ongoing saga of <strong>sentient sword</strong>\u00a0<strong>Bathoryn</strong> and his many wielders, the battle rages on against the demonic forces of <strong>Lord Vroll</strong>, spanning the vast reaches of the galaxy. <br> <br>The night is dark, and the hunt is endless. <strong>Prince Akran, the last of the Wolf Knights</strong>, wields\u00a0<strong>Bathoryn</strong> and the fury of the full moon to reclaim a dying land. <br> <br><strong>Will he rise, or will darkness claim all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/759ed6c4f8fd4b929836d636a6cb2983.avif?t=1773401544\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/759ed6c4f8fd4b929836d636a6cb2983.avif?t=1773401544 width=800 height=105 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/7db4edc216ab01c2e5c880e3867d1605.poster.avif?t=1773401544\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/7db4edc216ab01c2e5c880e3867d1605.webm?t=1773401544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/7db4edc216ab01c2e5c880e3867d1605.mp4?t=1773401544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash brutal <strong>melee strikes and precision-based attacks</strong>, countering foes in a deadly ballet of steel and fury. The sentient blade Bathoryn grants elemental powers, letting you cleave through enemies with <strong>fire, ice, and raw devastation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/8f7fcb1cf5e48905bed066fdc74d8cb4.avif?t=1773401544\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/8f7fcb1cf5e48905bed066fdc74d8cb4.avif?t=1773401544 width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/209f04e24065a98a49650a33e7ba8015.poster.avif?t=1773401544\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/209f04e24065a98a49650a33e7ba8015.webm?t=1773401544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/209f04e24065a98a49650a33e7ba8015.mp4?t=1773401544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the full moon, the Beast within emerges. Embrace the monstrous <strong>power of the Wolf Knights\u00a0</strong>and transform into a feral werewolf, unleashing a <strong>torrent of claws, teeth, and beastly power that obliterates all in your path.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/9c7ff491fb43dce04793f7c61b7bca90.avif?t=1773401544\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/9c7ff491fb43dce04793f7c61b7bca90.avif?t=1773401544 width=800 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/6359a5c70401afde96fb31655ac81a02.poster.avif?t=1773401544\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka